    "playtest": "Eight points; six four-node chains: Thrust, Sweep, Quick Cut, Long Dash, Quick Step, Max HP. Each node costs one and later nodes require the previous node. Sword and Dash are granted at the Workshop. Phase Dash is a separate one-point choice. Walk down branches to allocate deeper stacks; warp to Workshop to refund whole branches or enter free trials. Restart trial retains all allocations and initializes full health including HP upgrades. Arena base sword: reach 92, arc 1.2 radians, damage 8, interval 0.64 seconds. Four Sweeps reach 348 degrees and four Quick Cuts reach 0.2025 seconds without saturation. Crowd bats have 4 HP; durable bat has 24 HP."
